271
00:09:41,222 --> 00:09:43,993
and he was not criminally charged.

272
00:09:44,250 --> 00:09:47,000
The rules changed too.

273
00:09:47,220 --> 00:09:48,827
In late twenty thirteen,

274
00:09:48,827 --> 00:09:51,621
the regulator approved new customer

275
00:09:51,621 --> 00:09:52,920
