283
00:10:08,884 --> 00:10:10,954
Let me draw the repair.

284
00:10:10,954 --> 00:10:13,394
Here is the glass box again.

285
00:10:13,394 --> 00:10:14,744
Now add a camera,

286
00:10:14,744 --> 00:10:16,704
watching it every day.

287
00:10:16,704 --> 00:10:18,191
Now add a second key,

288
00:10:18,191 --> 00:10:20,494
held by a senior manager.

289
00:10:20,494 --> 00:10:22,724
And a phone line to the regulator.

290
00:10:22,754 --> 00:10:24,612
The box was always supposed to be

291
00:10:24,612 --> 00:10:25,514
locked.

292
00:10:25,514 --> 00:10:28,215
Now someone is watching the lock.

293
00:10:28,450 --> 00:10:31,077
So how did one point six billion

294
00:10:31,077 --> 00:10:32,990
dollars vanish?

295
00:10:33,060 --> 00:10:34,636
A firm made a giant bet that

296
00:10:34,636 --> 00:10:36,641
its own balance sheet did not show,

297
00:10:36,641 --> 00:10:38,871
and when the bet turned against it,

298
00:10:38,871 --> 00:10:41,348
customer money that should never have been

299
00:10:41,348 --> 00:10:44,200
touched was used to keep it alive.

300
00:10:44,470 --> 00:10:46,384
The farmers got their money back,

301
00:10:46,384 --> 00:10:48,920
but only after years of waiting.

302
00:10:49,030 --> 00:10:51,490
The rule had been there all along.

303
00:10:51,670 --> 00:10:53,598
The lesson is that a rule only

304
00:10:53,598 --> 00:10:55,740
works if someone is checking it.

305
00:10:56,070 --> 00:10:56,704
Today,

306
00:10:56,704 --> 00:10:58,889
regulators look inside that glass box

307
00:10:58,889 --> 00:11:00,800
every single day.

308
00:11:00,800 --> 00:11:02,394
That is the real legacy of the

309
00:11:02,394 --> 00:11:04,519
money that vanished in October twenty

310
00:11:04,519 --> 00:11:05,650
eleven.

311
00:11:05,920 --> 00:11:07,705
For the farmers who waited two and

312
00:11:07,705 --> 00:11:08,478
a half years,

313
00:11:08,478 --> 00:11:10,070
the money came back.

314
00:11:10,120 --> 00:11:12,320
The trust took longer.

315
00:11:12,584 --> 00:11:15,516
Next time on The Hidden Economics,

316
00:11:15,516 --> 00:11:19,012
we follow the money behind another hidden

317
00:11:19,012 --> 00:11:21,764
link of the world economy.

318
00:11:22,024 --> 00:11:24,642
This is The Hidden Economics.
